<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE SETS NEW RECORD FOR ALL SHARE INDEX.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE SETS NEW RECORD FOR ALL SHARE INDEX.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Wednesday it had set a new record closing value of 7547 for the JSE/Actuaries All Share Index.</p>
<p>&quot;The 7500 mark has been reached for the first time in the JSE's 109-year history,&quot; the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>The All Share Index reached a previous high of 7493 a day ago, on August 5, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
